{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-08_end",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-08",
  "title": "人心，向背無常",
  "storyCode": "R8-8",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e97d4049ca06088f6ebb13f3bd70874a8ebbc686b4462ccabc53f8b91258d9ef",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "清點傷亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正如你所想，這場將我們當作誘餌的戰鬥發生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你失望嗎，塔露拉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們做這一切都有原因，我也知道原因。這些確切的理由會阻止我產生過高的期望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......告密者應當被處死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們要如何從這些想自戰場逃開的人裡選出一個叛徒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些人為了片刻的喘息出賣了同胞。對他們的袒護是對戰士的傷害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，他們從來就沒有“忠誠”過，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要求隊伍裡的每個人都是完人？不可能的。不會存在這樣的隊伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "遊擊隊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "遊擊隊的戰士們也不是完人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們中想得多的人也就那麼些，其他的人，是因為種種原因留了下來願意付出，卻不一定想得清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "退下吧，士兵。不用與她爭辯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "摧毀一座城市比建立一座城市簡單得多，先生。讓他們留著吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果感染者可以透過各種辦法活下來，那我寧可這些方法統統都奏效。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塔露拉，你是不能設想，不去做出犧牲的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "犧牲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這難道該是我來下決定嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們很多人都已經做好了準備。不流血，無以得勝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我很清楚。你我都很清楚。你所謂的去南方，是一場戰爭的導火索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "帝國不會坐視感染者團結壯大。如果真如你宣傳的那樣，感染者將以一系列行為改變自己的命運，這場戰爭就在所難免。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們首先要讓感染者清楚，自己的生命是有意義的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之後再發生的那些，感染者都沒有義務去面對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你想遊擊隊參與這場戰爭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塔露拉，你是想等到一場你能從中獲利、找到機會的烏薩斯與他國的戰爭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是你想自己發動這場戰爭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（沉默）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不想做回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別妄想能有一個不慘烈的勝利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我不會去犧牲別人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你準備好承擔巨大的痛苦了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒有準備。因為我們必定受苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你企盼所有人都善良？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是相信自私和殘忍不會是烏薩斯人的天性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許有一天，你會遭遇真正的邪惡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想我已經見過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但願如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果有戰士曾向他的隊伍和他的同胞宣誓效忠，最後卻因一己之利而背叛，那這種行為，我自己就會發佈懲處名單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但與我們還未同心的另一群感染者，我們有什麼理由去對他們發動一場屠殺，一場征服？我們的敵人不在此處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塔露拉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我曾尊敬過許多人，大多不因他們強大，而只因他們正直。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——望汝如是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......謹記教誨，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佩特洛娃，霜星的位置呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_037#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......還在山坳口那。她說要守住據點直到我們成功奪下城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們去和他們合流吧。我得當面向她道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以......就這樣了嗎，大尉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至少還有三支本地駐軍在附近。我們要將他們各個擊破，才能把資源送出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "從結果來說她做的沒錯。移動城市不可能向前走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_084",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，塔露拉姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_084",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_084",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你心情不好嗎，塔露拉姐姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......伊諾，薩沙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們還想叫你們原本的名字嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_085",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......為什麼這麼問？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們行走在外，有一個保護自己的名字比較好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有的時候，如果自己不選名字，就只能一直被別人叫他們取的名字了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_085",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是你沒有換過名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為我不想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_085",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼？這和你剛才說的不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為......因為我想成為一個表裡如一的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_085",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你現在想的和做的不是一回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_084",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩沙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很可能，沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我要堅持這個名字。只不過，對於所有人來說，這個名字沒有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為我是誰對於大家來說並不重要。這個名字只對我自己重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_085",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我到底該叫你什麼？你這麼說，我不知道該怎麼叫你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩沙，我這麼對你說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是個反抗者，只是個普通的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "名字？不重要，任何人都不該記得我的名字，這個名字不該成為符號，也不能有別的力量。它只是我的名字，也只是個名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你想的話，只是現在，你可以叫我塔露拉。叫這個名字，可以讓我回頭，但也就只是這樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_085",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塔露拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伊諾也可以這麼叫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有些話可能對你們還太早......但我還是想說給你聽，薩沙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_085",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我希望你叫我塔露拉，是因為把我當做朋友。當做志同道合的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使我死了，你也會記得這個名字，但不是因為我在我的一生裡做了什麼事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只希望你記得我與你共處時的那些事。我希望你記得的塔露拉是一個朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_085",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可你在殺壞人。你在和他們戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "戰鬥的那個人我不想她有任何名字。因為我們每一個人都在戰鬥，我們所有人都是鬥士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要低頭跟著鬥士的腳步去走。不要！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是所有人都是愛國者，我們每個人都會犯錯。你要抬起頭，看他走向哪裡，而不是他們有著怎樣的頭銜，你閉著眼緊跟在身後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你記得的是你的朋友的名字。是和你朝夕共處的人的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是給你餵特別辣的糖還咬著牙笑的霜星，是給你燒奇奇怪怪的蔬菜雜燴的老師，是絕不會放棄訓練你的愛國者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "朋友，而不是鬥士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們所有鬥士都沒有名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_084",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......塔露拉姐姐，我不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......我希望作為你的朋友，讓你信任我，而不是讓你因為我的身份信任我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像所有我的朋友們一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
